Third-party notices
===================

syntaxes/php.tmLanguage.json

The PHP TextMate grammar comes from microsoft/vscode (extensions/php), which converts it from
KapitanOczywisty/language-php (grammars/php.cson, commit d94fd6b7dff1613d34bc0d36328f9982e65bd545, version 0.49.0).
That grammar was derived from atom/language-php and the TextMate PHP bundle. License of the upstream component
(from extensions/php/cgmanifest.json):

